+# Models extensions precede the add-provider controls
+
+English | [中文](guide.zh.md)
+
+## Change
+
+The Models settings page renders `settings.models.footer` after the provider rows and before the add-provider controls. Previously it rendered after the add controls. Third-party extensions registered in this slot, including account login cards, appear in the new position; registration identifiers and props remain unchanged.
+
+## Migration
+
+1. Keep existing `settings.models.footer` registrations; no plugin configuration or user-data migration is required.
+2. Open Settings → Models after upgrading and confirm the extension follows the provider rows and precedes Add provider.
